  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "This vehicle appears to be in working order as it was designed with wear and tear consistent with the age and mileage of the vehicle."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. The exterior of the vehicle was very dusty at the time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. The vehicle has miscellaneous dents in varying sizes all around the exterior, most hard to see in pictures. The underside shows areas of minor surface rust. See pictures. The left side of the rear bumper cover has a small chip. All four tires are worn past excepted levels, and should be replaced."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The steering wheel shows some wear and tear. Normal for mileage. There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The ambient temperature at the time of the inspection is 41 degrees and too cold to test The floor mats are dirty."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "I found no issues on the test drive. The engine had plenty of power and there were no misfires or smoking. The transmission worked as designed. The steering was responsive and the suspension was firm and the vehicle handled well. There were no abnormal vibrations or odd noises. The brakes were firm with no pulsation felt. There were no leaks found to the underside of the vehicle. I hooked up my Scan Tool to the computer system and found no current or pending codes. All of the live data looked good with no issues reported. See below and pictures for more info."
  }
